&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] ci: git caching + env improvements (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3818348422" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8072" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8072/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8072"&gt;#8072&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
